< VALUES ('b07f1e10112b7661e1d8eaf3b127227f', '1759266627.418203', 'C090N54TG79', 'message', 'EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID', E'<@EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID> I want to settle the cards earlier change from yesterday on what players told us, not on our gut. the friend sessions are in your workbook now, so give me one audience call from them: casual, RPG or no clear lead. casual lead means we hold the change. RPG lead means we keep it. no clear lead, we keep it\n\nthe rules I posted in the channel after my note still stand, and how a session gets its audience label and how the lead is read is in the audience read criteria. close the tickets the way your log note says. Robert already told you how not-counted sessions get handled\n\nwhat the memo holds is on the roadmap card. for context use the panel results I forwarded you, and read the panel the way I set out when Robert asked who those players were, plus retention the way Robert set it in the channel after Vincent''s post\n\nreply here with keep or hold, and tell <@EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID> in this channel whether the tutorial and level order work goes on. this is about the current game only, iterate or pivot is a later call', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, false, NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', '2025-09-30T21:10:27.418203Z', '{}');
